# Project Index

**The file tree and architecture map live in [`CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md). Read that file.**

`CLAUDE.md` is generated from and kept in step with the actual repository, so it cannot go stale
the way a second copy can. `ROADMAP.md` at the repo root carries the outstanding technical work.

Do not duplicate the tree into this file. The version this replaced still listed `index.html`,
`about.html`, `services.html`, `case-studies.html`, `contact.html` and `capsar.html` at the repo
root — pages that have not existed since the Eleventy migration, which made `src/**/*.njk` the
only place markup is authored.
